{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p13000-5994539c23e8b888fcc3","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"…선장 굿즈의 예약 판매가 시작되었습니다. 굿즈가 왜 이렇게 인기가 있을까요? 그건 선장이 너무 매력적이기 때문이죠! 엣헴, 현재 선장은 바로 접니다! 그래서……","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1467824010870296894","16404321114761428205"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-d9da44dc563e7a021484","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"선장님, 또 만났네요. 저를 보러 오셨나요? 아니면 무슨 일이 있나요?","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1845662707079368771"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-2ff5d85976be20bcac40","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"이번엔 더 길게 말씀해 주세요. 선장님의 발음은 독특해서 더 배우고 싶거든요","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13210300844495370683"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-2623015d740281a20774","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"매우 멋진 *쳇* 소리를 낸다?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14352790561829873354"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-c12247cfae5e544cd947","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"매우 멋진 *쳇* 소리를 낸다!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9639437020441281998"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-04940fd450cf326f3999","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"야거 는하라따 이같 보바 서래그?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2453354855991795210","8000998301317212475"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-b31fabcaad7447c62257","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"선장님, 전 바보가 아니에요! 이런 식으로 괴롭히지 마세요! 제 모습을 보세요——저를 괴롭히는 것은 선장님 자신을 괴롭히는 거라고요!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["9344014347183843487","18402339016119332546"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-b488a5a59fc7522852d9","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"내 얼굴을 파니까 장사는 잘 돼?","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["7419149962023954659","7622743682437424407"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-63f9aa644efd73ab1989","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"정확히는 모르지만, 절 보려고 오는 사람이 많아요. 선원들한테 사전 판매 반응이 아주 좋다는 얘기도 들었어요","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16384943051565701985","14259897121535335153"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-6e0c4a69e260bf4402ab","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"더 얘기할 건 없어","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10111518481704875810","4135995316475194518","4021390323052640703","4700378280141978415","10637336040760311495"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-2962842a5fbb74ef72fb","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"좀 더 얘기해 주세요. 목소리가 너무 좋아서 더 듣고 싶어요!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11520896119216347003","18268221394682235635"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-617d46276ae8dd4b6ae7","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"더 할 말이 없어","speaker":"","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["1482352966629255183","17967156932630732248"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-398455cbb2af3efe3713","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"음, 역시 선장님 목소리가 훨씬 좋네요…. 더 열심히 연습해야겠어요","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["3369084944350315832","6633079591639469444"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-6687bdad68ae9603b7fb","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"선장님, 다음에 또 이야기해요. 전 다시 광고를 해야 해서요","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14190783816726817144","15423611251023637184"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p13000-cbdda1d5a2d957c06c06","entryId":"other-npc-p13000","chapterId":"s6bea21444bd59216","text":"…환영합니다, 여러분! 저 현임 선장 [개척자]이(가) 탑승하신 모든 분들께서 즐거운 시간 보내시길 바랍니다!","speaker":"「미니 선장」","mission":"「미니 선장」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16698806974686095710","1585605974399398361"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6629176569579031580"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p13000","title":"「미니 선장」","page":"「迷你船长」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p13000-5994539c23e8b888fcc3","rowId":"other-npc-p13000-5994539c23e8b888fcc3","missionId":"npc-p13000","mission":"「미니 선장」","sceneId":"s6bea21444bd59216","scene":"NPC 대사 2","contextId":"wiki-context-07eb680105537bb32671cd23","page":"